{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"**She seems worried about the money. Another heart broken dame looking for a hand out. Getting money out of them is like getting blood out of stone. Looks like I'll be risking my hide for pocket lint again**\nThe list is partially obscured. You can make an investigation check, but your passive insight lets you know that he would be likely to notice.\n\"Depends whats the danger like? Do you have a pass to be wandering around hampstead?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T08:41:06.266000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T08:42:57.155000Z","id":"864063811816259614","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"I honestly don't know much else. Not really good in things that need thinkin'.\" She scratches her head in shame. \"I'm really sorry for bothering you, don't wanna put'cha in trouble without any coin to give,\" Meorys says after noticing her getting worried about the money.","created_at":"2021-07-12T08:44:01.109000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864064545160167494","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
